"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s12}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s13}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s14}}</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"The problem"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"A secure network requires more than a firewall"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Security vulnerabilities accumulate as organisations add offices, cloud services, remote workers and new devices. A firewall installed years ago, permissions granted for a one-off project, or infrastructure that was never replaced can all quietly widen your exposure."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Because everything continues working day to day, these weaknesses often go unnoticed. A network security review brings them into the open, so firewalls, access and infrastructure can be brought back in line with how your business actually operates."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Network protection is designed around your sites and how people connect to them, then monitored and maintained rather than installed and left. We are a team of five engineers supporting more than 30 UK businesses, from two-user teams to organisations of 150+ users. WhizzIT is Cyber Essentials certified and a Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider, so our security fundamentals are independently assessed rather than simply claimed."},{"k":"i5","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-network-security-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-network-security-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-network-security-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-network-security-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Data centre network switch with fibre connections plugged into its ports\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-network-security-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Network Security"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"Common network security risks we find"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Firewall rules not reviewed for years"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Network devices with outdated firmware"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Excessive permissions between internal segments"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Remote access without appropriate security controls"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Limited visibility into connected devices and traffic"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Legacy infrastructure creating unnecessary exposure"}]}